### 1. 로그인 전 CSRF 토큰 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/csrf
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.global.set("csrfToken", response.body.token);
%}


### 2. 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "bootertest26!@"
}


### 3. 로그인 후 CSRF 토큰 다시 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/csrf
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.global.set("csrfToken", response.body.token);
%}


### 4. Database RAG - AC 31건 / resultReference 발급
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "question": "AC 시리즈 조회해줘"
}

> {%
    client.global.set(
        "resultReference",
        response.body.resultReference
    );
%}


### 5. Database RAG - 전체 결과 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/database/results/{{resultReference}}
Accept: application/json


### 6. Database RAG - 전체 결과 CSV 다운로드
GET http://localhost:8080/api/database/results/{{resultReference}}/download
Accept: text/csv


### 7. Phase 11 Hybrid RAG E2E
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "question": "AC 시리즈 목록을 조회하고, 관리자도 보안등급 제한을 받는지 관련 문서를 근거로 같이 설명해줘."
}

> {%
    client.global.set(
        "resultReference",
        response.body.resultReference
    );
%}


### 8. Hybrid 결과 전체 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/database/results/{{resultReference}}
Accept: application/json


### 9. Hybrid 결과 CSV 다운로드
GET http://localhost:8080/api/database/results/{{resultReference}}/download
Accept: text/csv


### Phase 12 Safe Text-to-SQL E2E
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "question": "내 사용자명과 보안등급을 조회해줘."
}